
=============================================================================
<Docker build context folder for building spacenorm docker image>

./Dockerfile.opencv_gstreamer : build rule for OpenCV with GStreamer support
--> $ ./docker_build_opencv_gstreamer.sh : make하다가 에러가 남. Gemini는 CPU 갯수를 2개로 줄이면 될거라고 했는데 여전히 에러 발생. (2026.01.03)

./Dockerfile.robust_rtsp : build rule for legacy NVIDIA GPU and robust RTSP
--> $ ./docker_build_robust_rtsp.sh

./Dockerfile.rtx5060 : build rule for RTX-5060 (제일산업 로봇라인 서버)
--> $ ./docker_build_rtx5060.sh
=============================================================================

